  <section class="section"><div class="container-narrow prose"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>Privacy</h1><p>The Healing Souls is built to keep the first step simple: you can read, reflect, and explore without creating an account here.</p><p>Session booking happens on Topmate. Instagram, WhatsApp, and email actions open their own services when those contact paths are available.</p><p>Journal and check-in tools are meant for personal reflection. Keep only what feels useful, export what you want to save elsewhere, and clear anything you do not want to keep.</p></div></section>
